Changes made for Swarm Studio: ported from TypeScript to plain JavaScript; works on one section's
HTML fragment instead of a whole document; elements are addressed by their child-index path inside
the section; the brand-kit and runtime-override parts were left out; a move-element patch and
guards against script links, event-handler attributes and unsafe style values were added.
